   "title": "README",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "# Wan-VACE i2v (fast)\n\n**Wan2.1-VACE image-to-video \u2014 animates YOUR still, fast.**\n1.3B + CausVid LoRA. ~4 min/clip on this Mac.\n\n**Start-frame lock (the key):** VACE reference_image is only an object/bg hint \u2014 NOT a start frame. The real start frame is built as control_video = [your frame]+[white pad] with control_masks = [keep frame0]+[generate rest]. That is the SolidMask/RepeatImageBatch/ImageBatch/ImageToMask chain.\n\n**Proven settings:** CausVid strength **0.7** (test 0.3-0.7 if it shakes), KSampler **4 steps / cfg 1.0**, uni_pc, simple, shift 8. 832x480 (1.3B is 480p only), 81f @16fps.\n\n**Style comes from your start frame** \u2014 start photoreal, stay photoreal (1.3B alone skews cartoon; prompts barely fix it).\n\n**Swap the reference** in the LoadImage node to animate any still.\n**Final render:** switch UNET to wan2.1_vace_14B_fp16 + CausVid-14B lora @0.3 (photoreal, slower).\n\n---\n\ud83d\udcda [Tutorial](https://docs.comfy.org/tutorials/video/wan/vace) \u00b7 Docs: https://docs.comfy.org/"
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
